<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch PTT 1996 net profit NLG 2.46 bln. [corrected 13:44 gmt]</title>
<headline>Dutch PTT 1996 net profit NLG 2.46 bln. [corrected 13:44 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>GRONINGEN, Netherlands 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.29   vs   4.89</p>
<p>(Company corrects Net per shr figures from 5.01   vs   4.51)</p>
<p>    Net profit (billions)		2.462  vs   2.257</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.85   vs   2.60</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		 21.33   vs  19.86</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected post and telecoms group Koninklijke PTT Nederland NV to report a 1996 net profit of 2.44 to 2.48 billion guilders with a consensus at 2.464 billion.</p>
<p>    Operating income (billions)     4.373 vs    3.937</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    426     vs  342</p>
<p>    Tax (billions)			1.424 vs    1.265</p>
</text>
